{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13283","headline":"送郑二员外 · 皇甫冉","name":"送郑二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"置酒竟长宵，送君登远道。\n羇心看旅雁，晚泊依秋草。\n秋草尚芊芊，离忧亦渺然。\n元戎辟才彦，行子犯风烟。\n风烟积惆怅，淮海殊飘荡。\n明日是重阳，登高远相望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}